## Acceptance

- Recovery code works when authenticator unavailable
- Codes single-use and stored hashed
- Regenerating invalidates previous set
- Enroll flow alerts / requires viewing backup codes
- Docs/SECURITY updated

## QA checklist (draft)

1. Enroll MFA → must see 10 codes once → acknowledge
2. Login with backup code (authenticator unused) → session; code no longer works
3. Regenerate with TOTP → old codes fail; new codes work
4. Exhausted / 0 remaining shown in Profile
5. Admin Clear MFA removes codes; Admin shows remaining count
6. Failed recovery codes count toward challenge attempt limit
